  "system": {
    "featureForm": "passive",
    "description": "<p>The Harbinger is Contagious. When a PC within Very Close range of a Contagious creature takes an action, the PC rolls a <strong>[[/r d6]]</strong>. On a result of 1, the PC becomes Contagious. While Contagious, a PC has disadvantage on action rolls until they <strong>spend 3 Hope</strong> to clear the condition. Contagious adversaries are unaffected by the condition.</p>",
